      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLDEN SHOOZ (7) took full advantage of the inside draw when she led and cruised home by more than 14 metres in a nice return to form at this circuit and distance last week. Has to contend with a wide draw this time but she could go on with it with the confidence high. THE LADY DIOR (5) came from a similar barrier and finished third last week at this circuit and distance, beaten only 2 metres. That was her second placing from her last three outings so a win could be imminent. ALWAYS ADORNED (2) has been solid from the back line in her last two attempts and did well to finish runner-up here the last time she started on the front row. HARPERVILLE (3) gets her best draw since she placed here back in July so could be more competitive.",
